220→
221→/**
222→ * THE tool port: the deterministic solution/validation tools the work
223→ * order names (validate, step/apply, inspect) plus the navigation/
224→ * explanation/BOQ-step lookup commands. The production binding (solution
225→ * engine + BOQ services) is wired at composition time; the agent path
