155→
156→/**
157→ * Geometry explicitly resolved for one graph geometry-ref id (structural
158→ * mirror of AISE-020's `PlaneGeometryRecord`): unit normal + offset, the
159→ * plane offset's physical 1σ when the producer knows it (absent/null =
160→ * unknown) and the 3D boundary polygon in world metres when known.
